WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.400
Here's what done looks like.

2
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:05.937
Every privatelink zone is in the connectivity
subscription and linked to the hub.

3
00:00:05.937 --> 00:00:09.413
Every private endpoint has a
zone group in a central zone.

4
00:00:09.413 --> 00:00:13.461
No resource has an endpoint with
public network access still on,

5
00:00:13.461 --> 00:00:15.600
unless a decision record says why.

6
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.875
Every vault has the full
posture, or a dated plan.

7
00:00:18.875 --> 00:00:22.625
And nslookup from a linked machine
returned a private address.

8
00:00:22.625 --> 00:00:26.675
Next, Chapter 8: the policy that
holds all of this in place,

9
00:00:26.675 --> 00:00:28.750
and the evidence that it did.
